# Exploitation
## As svc_recovery
When trying to work with password 2025 it fails but it works with 2026 , seems this is why there was an error on the log: The password for svc_recovery is Em3rg3ncy2026.

```/etc/krb5.conf
[libdefaults]
    default_realm = LOGGING.HTB
    rdns = false

[realms]
    LOGGING.HTB = {
        kdc = 10.129.245.130
        admin_server = 10.129.245.130
    }

[domain_realm]
    .logging.htb = LOGGING.HTB
    logging.htb = LOGGING.HTB

```
After enabling ntp `sudo timedatectl set-ntp true` and sync with the target `sudo ntp-date logging.htb`, we get the ticket:
